 "script": [
  {
   "cue": [
    "title"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "小朋友们好！还记得第十九集的天气吗？今天，我们学更多和天气有关的词。"
    },
    {
     "en": "weather"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "map",
    "show:weather",
    "focus:weather"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "天气："
    },
    {
     "en": "weather"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:temperature",
    "edge:weather>temperature",
    "focus:temperature"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "天气有多冷多热，要看温度："
    },
    {
     "en": "temperature"
    },
    {
     "zh": "这个词很长，拆开读："
    },
    {
     "en": "tem, pe, ra, ture"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:degree",
    "edge:temperature>degree",
    "focus:degree"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "温度用度来表示："
    },
    {
     "en": "degree"
    },
    {
     "en": "It's 25 degrees today."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:heat",
    "edge:temperature>heat",
    "focus:heat"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "温度很高的时候，热浪滚滚，是炎热："
    },
    {
     "en": "heat"
    },
    {
     "zh": "还记得第十九集的热 hot 吗？"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:smoke",
    "edge:heat>smoke",
    "focus:smoke"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "太热太干，要小心着火冒烟。烟，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "smoke"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:dry",
    "edge:heat>dry",
    "focus:dry"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "很久不下雨，地面是干的："
    },
    {
     "en": "dry"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:wet",
    "edge:dry>wet",
    "focus:wet"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "被雨淋了，是湿的："
    },
    {
     "en": "wet"
    },
    {
     "zh": "干和湿："
    },
    {
     "en": "dry",
     "cue": [
      "focus:dry"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "wet",
     "cue": [
      "focus:wet"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:rainy",
    "edge:weather>rainy",
    "focus:rainy"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "下雨天："
    },
    {
     "en": "rainy"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:umbrella",
    "edge:rainy>umbrella",
    "focus:umbrella"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "下雨要打伞："
    },
    {
     "en": "umbrella"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:raincoat",
    "focus:raincoat"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "或者穿雨衣。雨，加上外套："
    },
    {
     "en": "rain"
    },
    {
     "en": "coat"
    },
    {
     "en": "raincoat"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:take",
    "edge:take>raincoat",
    "focus:take"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "出门前，记得带上："
    },
    {
     "en": "take"
    },
    {
     "en": "Take your raincoat."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:too",
    "edge:too>umbrella",
    "focus:too"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "也带上雨伞。也，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "too"
    },
    {
     "en": "Take your umbrella too."
    },
    {
     "zh": "还记得第二十集也学过一个 also 吗？"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:snowy",
    "focus:snowy"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "下雪天："
    },
    {
     "en": "snowy"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:ice",
    "edge:snowy>ice",
    "focus:ice"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "冷得水变成了冰："
    },
    {
     "en": "ice"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:freeze",
    "edge:ice>freeze",
    "focus:freeze"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "水变成冰，是结冰："
    },
    {
     "en": "freeze"
    },
    {
     "zh": "已经结冰了，要说",
     "cue": [
      "alt:freeze"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "froze"
    },
    {
     "en": "The water froze this morning."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:none"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "当一回天气预报员吧！"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [],
   "parts": [
    {
     "en": "Today is rainy and wet.",
     "cue": [
      "focus:rainy,wet"
